(text "FPGA interface (bom 1.3): Alinx ACVU13P module, carrier connector J6 (cascode_l[63:0] -> DAT01..64, banks 64/65, LVCMOS18; mclk B65_L12_P GC LVCMOS18 single-ended + clk_sel B65_L16_P - moved off J1 2026-10-08 so the clock block lives on the analog edge). Pin map = Alinx/ACVU13P-Pin-Assignment-20260703.csv + cascode_pins_gen.txt. Unused connector pins are no-connect type; all GND pins tied. V18 (translator A-side reference) is SUPPLIED BY THE SoM via VCCIO_65_EX / VCCIO_69/70/71 - no carrier 1.8 V regulator." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "083dbd2c-e686-4ceb-810f-1bde497e5887"))
(text "Clock tree (bom 1.1, item 15 option 2): no mux chip. Y301 (49.152) / Y302 (45.1584) CCHD-957 enabled one at a time via E/D (clk_sel -> Y302, !clk_sel -> Y301 through U301 LVC1G04; clk_sel pulled low = 48k family default), outputs joined through 33 R each on the XOCLK net -> root U302 (this channel; R channel root U303 on the R sheet, same net) -> 8 leaves U304..U311 -> 64 FF clocks MCLK01..64, 33 R at every driver pin. FPGA mclk = U312 LVC1G125 copy of XOCLK -> 100/120 divider -> J6 C30 (B65_L12_P / AW28, GC) as LVCMOS18 single-ended (FPGA XDC: IBUF, not IBUFDS - TODO). CCHD-957 verified (Rev N, 2026-10-08): E/D <= 0.3 Vcc -> output High Z (tri-state/standby, 200 ns disable, 1.5 mA), open/>= 0.7 Vcc -> active; pinout 1 E/D 2 GND 3 OUT 4 Vcc; footprint bfdac:Crystek_CCHD-957." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 22.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "adca063e-f994-4298-8d12-f72e6009aede"))
