(text "J1 control-plane pins (bank 71, xdc s4-7/10/5b) -> CTRL sheet: SPI_SCLK/CS_N/MOSI/MISO, FPGA_IRQ_N, EXT_RST_N (R27, new 2026-10-07), I2S_BCLK/LRCLK/DATA/DATA2 (H28, second AP source 2026-10-30), RLY_LINE_MUTE (-> OUT sheet unmute gate), LED_DBG0..3. relay_hp_mute (T28) / relay_hp_rails (N26) struck with bom 8, relay_level[1:0] (P26/N29) struck 2026-10-07 (level is digital, bom 7) - all left no-connect; RTL ports still exist. DATR01..64 = cascode_r (bank 67 on J5 + bank 66 on J6; moved off J1 bank 69 2026-10-08 so both channels' drive leaves the SoM on the analog edge) -> the 64 R-channel CELL sheets (root). JTAG_* and SOM_PG from J6 -> SOM sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 27.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fd86aa57-07b4-4ee0-9093-95767945d85e"))
