(text "Coefficient flash (bom 18b): 4 x MX66UM2G45GXRI00 2 Gb 1.8 V x1 SPI NOR populated (U320-U323 = 8 Gb; 1-Gb same-land-pattern alternative is four chips / reduced library), x1 FAST READ4B 0Ch at 100 MHz with 8 dummy clocks; 2-Gb mode = 88 filters at 10M taps, 18-bit mirrored; 1-Gb mode = 44 complete filters under 128-MiB per-device sector boundaries. One bus: CF_CLK, CF_DQ0..3 shared, four chip selects CF_CS0..3. J1 bank 70 (V18): CLK J35, CS0 J36, DQ0 H36, DQ1 G36, DQ2 H34, DQ3 G34, CS1 H37, CS2 H38, CS3 G37 - matches vu13p_dac_top.xdc s11b. x1 at 100 MHz target, forwarded SCK on user IO (not STARTUPE3). 10k pull-ups on each CS# and on unused x8 SIO2/SIO3; RESET# strapped to V18. Layout: place next to J1 A19-A26/B19-B29 on the carrier top side (NOT under the SoM); all CF_* <= 75 mm pad-to-ball, CLK/DQ daisy-chained U320->U323 with <= 10 mm stubs, 33R series on CF_CLK at the connector. Macronix 24-ball 5x5 ball map + land pattern verified against the 1-Gb/2-Gb datasheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 470.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b20ed050-d52c-4720-b3b1-446f4b4805ae"))
(symbol (lib_id "bfdac:MX66UM2G45G") (at 80.010 510.540 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "1ee4bc95-c475-4eaa-9596-b4e4a45a3681") (property "Reference" "U320" (at 83.010 509.240 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "MX66UM2G45G" (at 83.010 511.840 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "bfdac:Macronix_MX66UM_CSPBGA-24_6x8mm_5x5_P1.0mm" (at 80.010 510.540 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 80.010 510.540 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "Macronix 2 Gb 1.8 V serial NOR coefficient store (x1 SPI / x8 OPI); 4 devices, 4 CS = 8 Gb nominal; x1 FAST READ4B 0Ch at 100 MHz with 8 dummy clocks; same 24-ball land pattern and command family as the 1-Gb MX66UM1G45GXDI00; exact Macronix pin map wired per datasheet" (at 80.010 510.540 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "MX66UM2G45GXRI00" (at 80.010 510.540 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "A4" (uuid "70a68b1e-f687-4df6-8006-f70789b346b3")) (pin "B2" (uuid "ffe17f2f-53bb-4e20-afcc-cfe3f4690294")) (pin "B3" (uuid "5c52d464-8420-4446-a454-36601cea7758")) (pin "B4" (uuid "73104c10-2f44-4c3a-b786-d9498828b278")) (pin "C1" (uuid "1bb3438f-facf-4286-b5ff-5190c350ebea")) (pin "C2" (uuid "d185b6b0-bb1e-484b-a79c-9c7fb0418ba5")) (pin "D1" (uuid "9ab1e47d-9394-4442-8e8d-2cf28ed5aa5b")) (pin "E4" (uuid "c16dda49-26c5-4f52-b125-0fc8793b8c68")) (pin "E5" (uuid "88e1e42e-567b-46c0-8b7f-c937efa01d6b")) (pin "A5" (uuid "6b45ae3c-d2ab-48f6-949d-307815e019f6")) (pin "C3" (uuid "38e1c59b-2378-43b9-9ce3-8094c94da19f")) (pin "A2" (uuid "098ac62d-1391-410c-9280-731211ee0a92")) (pin "D3" (uuid "1d9c1290-4000-4bef-bb33-15b53b496b83")) (pin "D2" (uuid "4757a3e1-ce5f-45e3-a755-f838699a2715")) (pin "C4" (uuid "a14ed7fd-9eaa-411b-9cf1-ee9e25e9ce64")) (pin "D4" (uuid "efec61bf-980b-489b-9602-372ef69566d7")) (pin "D5" 